{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_03",
  "title": "臨時停車",
  "storyCode": "RS-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "addd059f4297bedcaa7472416b1525180a0ef1207c76e842a4d5aee6e66baa03",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "各位乘客，本次列車到達終點站——\n銀心湖站。\n銀心湖位於盆地中央，湖面霧氣瀰漫，水質清澈，是謝拉格土地上孕育出的眾多瑰寶之一。\n傳說銀心湖是耶拉岡德落下的第一滴眼淚，在冬季，您可以於冰封的湖面上漫步，透過冰面，還可以觀賞冰層深處的風景。\n而最新建起的耶拉岡德像佇立於銀心湖的湖心島之上，耶拉岡德在此，注視著謝拉格與其子民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "各位乘客，本次列車……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "……所以，一切都是誤會？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "沒有隱情，沒有追殺，沒有什麼可能在車上的重要人物，什麼都沒有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "如果你指的是讓我登上這趟列車的“重要人物”，那就是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "短短一個月就在牧民間揚名，擅長醫治馱獸的哈洛德·克雷加文子爵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "咳咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我的榮幸，女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "請您原諒，鐧女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "您手套上的血跡，實在令人難以不多做一些設想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "血跡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "你很在意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "這麼在意，告訴你也無妨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "洗耳恭聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "莉莉生產時的情況不是很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "突然早產，出血量很大，費了我不少功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "早產……出血量還不少？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "這可不是小事，鐧女士，莉莉她現在狀況如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "我幫她做了緊急處理，但後續的護理還需要專業人士來做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "老雷昂指名說最信得過你，克雷加文。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "之後就要看你的本事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "好！我立刻就趕過去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "你現在的表情有點遺憾。怎麼，不符合你的想像？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "沒關係，我不介意讓你的想像成真。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "這就不必了，女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "說說看，你們都誤會了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "這個……哈哈，銀心湖真是個不錯的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "今天的天氣也不錯，風和日麗，空氣清新……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "……維多利亞人連轉移話題都要談論天氣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "這種套話我聽過一萬次，膩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "請您見諒，在維多利亞，我們會從小學習如何靠我們糟糕的天氣來開啟話題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "請您不要隨便抹黑維多利亞的形象，子爵閣下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "喂——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你們怎麼還在這站著聊天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "不就是有點小誤會嗎，你們說開了沒有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "當然，當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "如果不是某些人危言聳聽，也不至於產生這樣的誤會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "行吧，你們都解決了就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "雖然在列車上跑跑挺有趣的，但我不想再蹲在桌子底下吃灰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "對了，我剛剛去前面看了看，那邊有導遊姐姐指路，我還要了兩張地圖來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "這裡離銀心湖就一條街的距離，很方便的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "怎麼說，我們現在出發？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "這……我很抱歉，羅莎琳，我無法兌現之前的承諾了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "現在有一位更加需要我的女士，我必須盡快趕到她的身邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "……莉莉真的是馱獸吧？不是什麼，維多利亞貴族的暗語？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我求您！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "好了，知道了，你還是趕快去看看那位“莉莉女士”吧，我這沒什麼，我自己一個人完全沒問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "羅莎琳……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你、你怎麼了，幹嘛這副表情？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "你真是個善解人意的好女孩！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "來，讓我們先交換一下聯絡方式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "如果遇到困難，隨時可以聯絡我，哈洛德樂意為你效勞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "還有你的父親……謝拉格美男子，對吧？我也會幫你留意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那就多謝了，大叔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你們繼續聊吧，我先走了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "唉，多好的孩子，剛剛失去母親，卻還能如此樂觀，如此堅強……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "……謝拉格美男子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "啊，您聽到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "羅莎琳這孩子這趟來謝拉格，就是想要找到多年未見的父親。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "真是感人，希望她能一切順利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "父親……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "那個女孩是這麼說的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "既然誤會已經解開，那……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "鐧女士，我是您忠實的支持者，不知可否賞臉簽名——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "沒空。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "先走了，你記得照顧好莉莉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哎，且慢，請留步，鐧女士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哎——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "……這就走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "我們的黑騎士女士看起來並不喜歡那段輝煌的過往經歷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "這也難怪，她畢竟是以那樣的方式被卡西米爾驅逐……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哦，不好意思，原來你還在這。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "我不想隨意發言，惹怒那位黑騎士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "很有自知之明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "發言確實應當更加謹慎，這是我的失誤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "不過，子爵閣下，您當真相信鐧女士給出的理由？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "黑騎士自脫離卡西米爾，跟隨希瓦艾什前往謝拉格以來，一直都是其手下的心腹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "據我所知，這位女士最近一段時間，都在某座山中，為喀蘭貿易訓練一批新式部隊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "而近期我們的人發現，謝拉格與外界的進出口交易頻繁，特別是在一些敏感的材料方面，交易數額都有些異常……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "……所以呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "一切都還只是我的推測，閣下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "但我想，您應該也是有所懷疑，所以才會留下那位羅莎琳小姐的聯絡方式，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "看來在維多利亞的工作經歷讓你得了無法信任他人的病，我替你感到遺憾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "職責所在，還請見諒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "今天發生的事，我會向公爵閣下如實報告。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "慢著……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "容我再次提醒您，子爵閣下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "請記住您身負的職責，不要辜負公爵閣下的期望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "這並非一場觀光之旅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "關於與喀蘭貿易的合作，不知泰勒先生考慮得如何了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "角峰已經帶您參觀喀蘭貿易旗下的礦場與工廠，您對謝拉格與喀蘭貿易是否滿意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞富商",
      "text": "對希瓦艾什先生您的公司，我當然是滿意的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞富商",
      "text": "只不過，希瓦艾什先生，您也是生意人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞富商",
      "text": "我想您一定能理解，這樣大的案子，若是與喀蘭貿易合作，我一定不會如此猶豫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞富商",
      "text": "但要說與謝拉格官方合作……大家對謝拉格的了解也還不深，許多事情，我還是需要更加慎重地考慮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "這是當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞富商",
      "text": "前幾天，我還在街上瞧見了維多利亞的士兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞富商",
      "text": "希瓦艾什先生，謝拉格與維多利亞……該不會鬧什麼矛盾吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "我可以向您保證，您在謝拉格的安全不會受到任何威脅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "您可以慢慢考慮，泰勒先生。謝拉格不會令您失望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞富商",
      "text": "那是再好不過了！希望我們能合作愉快，希瓦艾什先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "角峰，明天你繼續帶泰勒先生參觀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "正常範圍內的需求，都可以滿足對方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "……不過老爺，我們真的要跟這位泰勒先生合作嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "你認為他不是一個好的合作對象？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "屬下不敢擅自評判。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "只不過，這位先生在謝拉格的這段時間，一次次推脫合約簽署，在利潤分配上反口了數次，恐怕……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "你說得不錯，泰勒先生是一位精明的商人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "現在的謝拉格只能與這些嗅覺敏銳的精明商人合作，而他們，卻有不只一個選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "讓謝拉格成為他們的唯一選項，就是今後我要做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "老爺……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "角峰，你先去看看鐧的新兵隊伍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "讓他們護衛泰勒先生出行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "恩希歐迪斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "text": "難得你會用通訊器，我以為你很討厭這種遠程聯絡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "我只是討厭別人聯絡我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "恩希歐迪斯，有件事我想你該知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "我在去銀心湖的列車上遇到了個羅德島來的丫頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "你和羅德島又有什麼新合作了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "瞧一瞧看一看！特製謝拉格雪花乾酪，大號馱獸擺件，精美聖女畫像！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "謝拉格特產應有盡有了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "競爭商家",
      "text": "最新馱獸盲盒發售！數量有限，歡迎選購！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嚯，好熱鬧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "讓我看看，這都賣的什麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "這聖女畫像畫的什麼啊，初雪怎麼被畫成這樣了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "哎，小姐怎麼這麼說呢，這畫像可是我們聖女大人親自過目的，有保證的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "好，有保證。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "老闆，給我來一個那個什麼雪花乾酪，這就是現在最熱門的特產？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "說不定我小時候其實吃過呢……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "欸小妹，你也是謝拉格人啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "算是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "早說嘛，那你別買那個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "那個是賣給外國遊客的，我們不用買那個！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "我幫你拿點這種碎乾酪，味道不差，吃這個就可以啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你們這店……這不是坑外國人嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "怎麼能這麼說呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "小妹，你看這雪花乾酪，看看這包裝，多好看多有品味啊，遊客買特產嘛，不就為了個精緻與格調？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "我就是多賺點包裝費，又不是以次充好，乾酪味道一定是有保證的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "……有點道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那就給我來點這個碎乾酪吧，順便，老闆，跟你打聽個事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我們謝拉格有沒有什麼大家公認的美男子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "美男子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "這……雖然我是佩爾羅契家的人，但這事我可得說老實話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "要說我們謝拉格公認的第一美男子，那應該得是恩希歐迪斯老爺吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "恩希歐迪斯……呃，銀灰？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "對對，就是希瓦艾什家的那位當家人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "不可能。對，絕對不可能！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "老闆，再換一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "呃，那……那……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "算了算了，隨口問問罷了，就當個玩笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "問你個別的事，關於銀心湖旁邊那座山。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "就那邊那座，那座山有什麼說法沒有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "哦！那個啊，那是弗根山啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "那可是我們這塊有名的定情聖地，年輕小情侶啊，都喜歡往那去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "小情侶……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "現在還搞了什麼宣傳語，哎喲什麼“一起看日出就能永遠在一起”囉，什麼“情定謝拉格堅如寒冰”囉，嘖嘖，超肉麻的耶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "好多遊客都愛往上跑，要掛什麼證明感情的金鎖……欸，對了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "聽說阿克托斯老爺挺愛上山打獵，好幾次被遊客打擾了，還很不高興呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嗯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "行，我知道了，謝了老闆，這是乾酪的錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特產商人",
      "text": "謝謝惠顧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "這就是媽媽經常提起的銀心湖……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "還有那座山，弗根山。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "風景確實還不錯，嗯，不過這種程度的冰湖烏薩斯也不是沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "喲，冰層還挺厚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那邊那個看不清臉的……就是耶拉岡德像？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哇哦，好高，好大的工程，這麼大的雕像真不知道得用掉多少石頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "石頭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我們的耶拉岡德像可沒有那麼簡單！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "你這人還挺懂欣賞的嘛，這裡可是觀賞耶拉岡德像最好的地點了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "呃，你哪位？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我是——\n咳、咳嗯！我是誰不重要，重要的是你剛剛說的話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "這座耶拉岡德像才不是用普通石頭建造的，為表示對耶拉岡德的敬愛，我們用的材料可都是最高等級的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "最高等級？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "具體是指什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "哎呀都說了最高等級，當然就是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "——呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "怎麼了，咬到舌頭了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "這種事當然是要保密了，怎麼能輕易告訴遊客呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "關於材料，詳細的我不能告訴你，但總之……總之很厲害就對了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你剛剛不是還差點說漏嘴了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "我最後沒說出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "好好，你沒說出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那你慢慢在這欣賞，我先走了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "啊，喂！你等一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "還有什麼事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你……\n呃，對了！你是遊客吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "兩天後的早晨，就在這裡，會舉辦耶拉岡德像的落成儀式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "如果那時候你還在謝拉格，一定要記得來觀禮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你怎麼這麼自說自話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "兩天後的事情還說不定呢，現在看看不也一樣嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "那怎麼能一樣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "那可是聖女大人會親自出席主持的儀式，搞不好真能看到耶拉岡德顯靈呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "你……對了，你叫什麼名字？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "羅莎琳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "全名。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這麼麻煩……\n（烏薩斯語）羅莎琳·塔季揚諾夫娜·拉里娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "好，羅莎琳！我邀請你！這樣可以了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "我休露絲·布朗陶正式邀請你，羅莎琳·塔季揚諾夫娜·拉里娜！參加兩天後的耶拉岡德像落成典禮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "到時候你就會知道，這座耶拉岡德像是最特別的，和其他的都不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "這麼有自信？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "好啊，那我就拭目以待了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "喂，等等，我還沒給你邀請函欸！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "這傢伙……跑這麼快幹嘛啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "休露絲，布朗陶家家主的妹妹，近年來作為使節頻繁代表謝拉格出使他國。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "難道說，羅莎琳是她從中安排的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "應該想辦法竊聽的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "text": "先生，你已經拿著你的破報紙在我的攤位面前站了五分鐘了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "text": "你要是不買東西的話能不能借過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "哦，抱歉，請給我來一杯馱獸奶茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "這樣應該就算完成菈塔托絲那個臭女人的吩咐了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "突然要我盯著個小丫頭，還要想辦法繼續接觸對方……莫名其妙的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "不過，這小丫頭，仔細一看還真是有點眼熟……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "text": "露絲？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "text": "真的不用我幫忙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "尤卡坦",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "事情交給我，你還有什麼不放心的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "走，我們回去，我可要好好問問菈塔托絲，這個叫羅莎琳的小丫頭到底是什麼來頭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
